cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Feanor, please cite it as below. / Si usas Feanor, cítalo así."
type: software
title: "Feanor"
abstract: >-
  Feanor turns scanned or photographed books, thesis PDFs, Word documents and
  PowerPoint presentations in Spanish into Markdown. It flattens pages that
  curve towards the spine before OCR, detects where the text of each page
  comes from, locates the references section, and processes whole folders of
  theses with one result per file and a full record of each run.
